  "fullDescription": "Transform your ordinary photos into stunning botanical mixed-media masterpieces with this professional Creative Art Photo Effect Photoshop Template!\nPerfect for portrait photographers, digital artists, wedding studios, print-on-demand sellers, and creative entrepreneurs. Turn any portrait into elegant gallery-worthy wall art featuring lush green foliage, realistic watercolor splashes, dripping paint effects, and artistic framing — no drawing or advanced skills required.\n✨ Key Features\n\n🎨 Fully Editable PSD Template with Smart Objects — simply drag & drop your photo for instant results\n🖼️ High Resolution — 6000 x 4500px (or higher), print-ready quality\n🌿 Botanical Foliage & Greenery Overlays — realistic eucalyptus, leaves, and organic elements that blend beautifully\n🖌️ Artistic Effects — watercolor splashes, paint drips, textured brush strokes, and abstract background options\n🔄 Multiple Style Variations — green tones, abstract yellow/black accents, soft painterly portraits, and more\n📁 Well-Organized Layers — fully customizable colors, intensity, foliage placement, and backgrounds\n🪄 Smart Object Technology — non-destructive editing, easy photo replacement\n💻 Compatible with Photoshop CC 2015 and newer\n⚡ Fast & Easy — professional results in seconds\n\n💡 Perfect For:\n\nPortrait & wedding photography\nCustom digital wall art and canvas prints\nEtsy/POD shops selling personalized gifts\nSocial media content creators\nFamily portraits, fashion editorials, and artistic branding\n\n📦 What You Get:\n\n1 High-Quality Main PSD Template (Smart Object enabled, fully layered)\nAdditional style variation PSD files (as shown in preview)\nStep-by-step PDF instructions + video tutorial on how to use & customize\n\nThis premium photoshop photo effect is designed for maximum creative flexibility while delivering consistent, beautiful results every time. Great for creating unique, sellable digital art portraits that stand out!",
